<title>UK: Svenska Handelsbanken sets $300 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Svenska Handelsbanken sets $300 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International and UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     ZERO	PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.902    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  REOFFER    99.902</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
